  "seoBody": "<section><span class=\"eyebrow\">Quickler in the UAE</span><p>Across the UAE, field teams inspect towers, malls, plant rooms, fleets and sites every day, then lose hours turning paper and photos into something a manager can act on. Quickler removes that gap. Your fielders answer the inspection on WhatsApp, the account already on their phone, and every check lands as a structured digital record on a manager dashboard. There is nothing to install, and dormant users are free. When a formal document is needed, a PDF exports straight from the record.</p></section><h2>The fielder uses WhatsApp; the manager gets a live record.</h2><p>WhatsApp is the default way people in the UAE communicate, on site and off it. Quickler runs the inspection inside that same conversation, so a worker on a rooftop in Dubai or a warehouse in Sharjah needs no new login, no download and no training.</p><ul><li>The fielder answers each question by text, voice note or photo</li><li>Quickler asks for what is missing and confirms as it goes</li><li>Every answer is captured as structured data, not a free-text mess</li><li>The result appears on a dashboard with red, amber and green fault status</li><li>A PDF exports from that record when a client or authority needs a document</li></ul><p>The point is the structured digital record. It is live and machine-readable, so a head office can see results across an estate without waiting for paper to travel back from the field.</p><h2>Upload your own form and Quickler builds the workflow.</h2><p>Quickler is not a single-trade tool. It is rooted in UK compliance work (EICR, gas safety, van checks) but the engine is job-agnostic. The UAE's field-services landscape spans high-rise facilities management, district cooling and HVAC, fire and life safety, fleet and logistics, construction, oil and gas support, retail and hospitality maintenance. Quickler runs the lot from the same place.</p><ul><li>Upload your existing inspection, checklist or certificate form</li><li>Quickler turns it into a guided WhatsApp workflow automatically</li><li>Facilities rounds, fire checks, plant inspections and fleet walkrounds all run the same way</li><li>Condition ratings, defect logging, photos and on-site acknowledgement carry across every job</li></ul><p>If your team inspects something and writes it down, quickler can run it, whatever the trade and wherever in the Emirates the work happens.</p><h2>Built to work anywhere, used across markets including the UK and beyond.</h2><h3>Works on the phone they already have</h3><p>The UAE workforce is large, mobile and multinational. Quickler needs no app store listing, no managed devices and no onboarding for the fielder. If they can send a WhatsApp message, they can run an inspection.</p><h3>A dashboard, not a drawer of PDFs</h3><p>Facilities and maintenance firms managing many buildings need to see status at a glance. Quickler gives a live, machine-readable record with fault status, and exports a PDF only when a document is genuinely required.</p><h3>A privacy-respecting base</h3><p>Records are hosted on EU servers in Germany under a GDPR-aligned design, giving UAE firms a neutral, well-governed home for their field compliance data.</p><h2>Running Quickler in the United Arab Emirates.</h2><h3>Do fielders need to install anything?</h3><p>No. They use the WhatsApp account already on their phone. There is nothing to download, and dormant users are free, so you only pay for who actually works.</p><h3>Is it only for electrical or gas work?</h3><p>No. Upload any inspection or checklist form. UAE teams use it for facilities, fire safety, HVAC, plumbing, fleet, lone-worker and site checks.</p><h3>What do managers actually see?</h3><p>A structured digital record on a dashboard with red, amber and green fault status, updated live. A PDF exports from it whenever a formal document is needed.</p><h3>What language and currency does it use?</h3><p>Workflows run in English today, with further languages on the roadmap. Pricing is in GBP, with EUR and USD on request.</p><h3>How do I get started?</h3><p>Start free at <a href=\"https://app.quickler.co/signup\">app.quickler.co/signup</a>, or <a href=\"/pages/help/index.html#contact-form-section\">get in touch</a> to talk through a workflow for your team in the UAE.</p><h3>Where can I read more?</h3><p>See how quickler <a href=\"/pages/global-field-compliance.html\">works in any country</a>, or browse the full set of <a href=\"/pages/services.html\">workflows</a>.</p>",
